{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "kp19-03",
  "sourceBatch": "unified73",
  "teachingKind": "business",
  "conceptBlocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "什么是复购率？",
      "emphasis": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "复购率是期间有至少两笔有效购买的客户人数÷有至少一笔有效购买的客户人数×100%。",
      "emphasis": []
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "不是复购订单占比，也不是所有注册客户中复购客户的占比。",
        "一个订单可能有多条商品明细，必须按订单编号计数；同一客户的有效订单次数再用于分类。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "syntax": {
    "purpose": "客户复购率与统计粒度的语法模板如下。"
  },
  "dataDescriptions": {
    "stores": "共 3 行；字段：store_id、store_name、city、fulfillment_warehouse_id。",
    "customers": "共 4 行；字段：customer_id、customer_name、signup_date、region、member_since_date。",
    "calendar_days": "共 12 行；字段：day、month_key、day_index。",
    "orders": "共 11 行；字段：order_id、store_id、customer_id、session_id、order_date、channel、status、cancellation_reason。",
    "order_items": "共 15 行；字段：order_item_id、order_id、product_id、promotion_id、quantity、unit_price_cents、discount_cents、unit_cost_cents。",
    "returns": "共 2 行；字段：return_id、order_item_id、return_date、quantity、refund_cents。"
  },
  "problem": "2025全年、线上、已完成且扣退款后净额大于0的订单，关联客户主档。全额退款、取消、待付款、期外或线下订单不计。原项目净订单视图已经处理已完成状态及退款；再次扣退款会重复冲减。无有效购买客户时返回人数0、比率NULL。",
  "methodBlocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "先在订单层过滤范围和净额，再连接客户主档排除无有效客户编号的记录。COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) 保证一笔订单只数一次；",
      "emphasis": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GROUP BY c.customer_id 将订单粒度转换为客户粒度。外层 COUNT(*) 是购买客户人数，因为内层每人仅一行；",
      "emphasis": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "SUM(CASE WHEN purchase_count>=2 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) 给每位复购客户计1。",
      "emphasis": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "乘100.0、NULLIF 防止整数截断和除零，COALESCE 让空输入的复购人数为0。独立示例直接模拟已处理好的订单视图，不代表原始订单表的全部记录。",
      "emphasis": []
    }
  ],
  "breakdown": [
    {
      "kind": "runnable",
      "title": "每位客户的有效购买订单数",
      "sql": "WITH purchases AS (\n  SELECT c.customer_id, COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) purchase_count\n  FROM customers c JOIN v_order_net o ON o.customer_id=c.customer_id\n  WHERE o.channel='online' AND o.order_date BETWEEN '2025-01-01' AND '2025-12-31'\n    AND o.net_cents>0\n  GROUP BY c.customer_id\n)\nSELECT * FROM purchases ORDER BY 1, 2 LIMIT 3;",
      "purpose": "先算出每位客户在 2025 年线上的有效购买订单数 purchase_count。",
      "reason": "要先在客户层面数订单，才能判断每位客户买了几次；用 COUNT(DISTINCT order_id) 避免同一订单被重复计数。",
